Revision history for Perl-Unix-Keywords

0.03 2026-09-06
     - fixed Win32 xargs argument preservation when argv values contain embedded
       double quotes; preserve backslashes preceding embedded quotes according
       to Win32 C-runtime command-line parsing rules
     - fixed Windows portability in xargs/composition tests by using helper
       scripts instead of multiline perl -e command strings
     - added a dedicated MSWin32 argv regression test covering spaces, shell
       metacharacters, quotes, and backslashes
     - added GitHub Actions CI across Linux and native MSWin32 Perl, including
       source-tree and generated-distribution testing

0.01 2026-09-05
     - initial release
     - added prototype-based walk, group, uniq, and xargs operations
     - added POD describing semantics, context behavior, composition, and limitations
     - added regression tests for prototypes, traversal, grouping, canonicalization,
       subprocess execution, errors, and composition
